<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9784] Performance drop on sql yardstick benchmarks</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9784</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Please take a look at the attachment.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Grid configuration:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;4 servers / 8 clients&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;java 8&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;64 threads, 60s warmup, 180s duration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
